 padding-left: 0.222em;">âˆ’</span><span class="msubsup" id="MathJax-Span-200" style="padding-left: 0.222em;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 2.9em; height: 0px;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(3.364em, 1000.69em, 4.148em, -1000em); top: -3.978em; left: 0em;"><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-201" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-bold-italic;">Ï‰</span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 3.978em;"></span></span><span style="position: absolute; top: -3.828em; left: 0.718em;"><span class="texatom" id="MathJax-Span-202"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-203"><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-204" style="font-size: 70.7%; font-family: MathJax_Math-bold-italic;">g</span><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-205" style="font-size: 70.7%; font-family: MathJax_Math-bold-italic;">l</span><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-206" style="font-size: 70.7%; font-family: MathJax_Math-bold-italic;">o</span><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-207" style="font-size: 70.7%; font-family: MathJax_Math-bold-italic;">b</span><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-208" style="font-size: 70.7%; font-family: MathJax_Math-bold-italic;">a</span><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-209" style="font-size: 70.7%; font-family: MathJax_Math-bold-italic;">l</span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 3.978em;"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mo" id="MathJax-Span-210" style=""><span style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">âˆ¥</span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 3.978em;"></span></span><span style="position: absolute; top: -4.455em; left: 6.202em;"><span class="texatom" id="MathJax-Span-211"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-212"><span class="mn" id="MathJax-Span-213" style="font-size: 70.7%; font-family: MathJax_Main-bold;">2</span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 3.978em;"></span></span></span></span></span><s